pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: result-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 420, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      letterSpacing: 1.6
      align: [left, middle]
      text: RESULT 1 · MAIN EFFECT
  - elementId: result-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 72, 832, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.2
      align: [left, top]
      text: Treatment reduced recovery time by 38% (p < 0.01)
  - elementId: result-reading
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 168, 368, 250]
    content:
      fontSize: 17
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>The effect appears in every site and survives the pre-registered controls.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px">The gap widens with baseline severity — the group with the highest baseline gains most.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px"><span style="color:$primary; font-weight:bold">Read:</span> the lower bound of the interval is still a 24% reduction.</p>
  - elementId: figure-frame
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [480, 156, 416, 296]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: figure-placeholder
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 284, 376, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: "Replace this frame with media/fig-2.png · fit: contain"
  - elementId: figure-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 462, 416, 42]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.35
      align: [left, top]
      text: Figure 2. Recovery time by condition (mean ± SD; n = 48). Higher bars indicate slower recovery.
  - elementId: source-line
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 504, 700, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "Source: Author et al. (2025), Journal of X, Fig. 2; author's re-plot of the published values."
  - elementId: page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 504, 28, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "06"
